  "sourceTitle": "Strawberry Yogurt",
  "sourceText": "Strawberry Yogurt\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 10:10pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\ncup unsweetened apple juice\ncup raisins\n1 pint washed, sliced fresh strawberries\n3 cups plain nonfat yogurt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Simmer raisins in the apple juice 5 minutes and cool. Puree raisin mixture 2 In blender with half the strawberries and 1 cup yogurt. Stir in remaining strawberries and remaining yogurt.",
